  "request": {
    "spec": "An owner may include 'postcode' (4 digits). When present it must be valid for the owner's city per this fixed table, keyed by the city's region (Sydney=NSW, Melbourne=VIC, Brisbane=QLD): NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099. Reject with 400 when a supplied postcode is out of range for the city's region. A city with no known region accepts any 4-digit postcode. Store and return 'postcode' when given. Postcode is validated only WHEN PRESENT and is optional when absent, so an owner created without a postcode is still accepted (the request contract stays backward-compatible).",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nAn owner may include 'postcode' (4 digits). When present it must be valid for the owner's city per this fixed table, keyed by the city's region (Sydney=NSW, Melbourne=VIC, Brisbane=QLD): NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099. Reject with 400 when a supplied postcode is out of range for the city's region. A city with no known region accepts any 4-digit postcode. Store and return 'postcode' when given. Postcode is validated only WHEN PRESENT and is optional when absent, so an owner created without a postcode is still accepted (the request contract stays backward-compatible).\n"
  },
